{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "SONIC WINGS REUNION",
    "steam_appid": 3477860,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 20XX, cities around the world were attacked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious organization \u201cFata Morgana,\u201d which possesses superweapons and controls the world's military arsenal with unknown technology, has returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The international secret rescue team \u201cProject Blue,\u201d a group of sky-riding knights, stands up against this global threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits them as they take the fight to a powerful enemy for various reasons? ......!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SONIC WINGS REUNION is a sequel to the arcade-style shooter SONIC WINGS. The previous version was sold in 1998.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 8 characters and destroy the mysterious organization \u201cFatamornagana\u201d that has progressed into the modern world. The scenario changes depending on the combination of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight initial characters, with hidden characters unlocked under certain conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight stages (including bonus stages) to fight in cities and locations in the modern world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight stages (including bonus stages) in which players fight in cities and locations in the modern world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant futuristic weapons from the original game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local cooperative play is supported. Conversation scenarios change with cooperative play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The co-op scenarios can be enjoyed in single-player mode as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three sound modes are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original sound mode is composed by Sonic Wings series sound composer Soshi Hosoi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Arrange Sound Mode, the music of previous titles is completely arranged by Japan's most renowned sound creator. The user can set the music to be played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Mao Mao mode, Mao Mao's song is played as background music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The user can select the level of difficulty, invincibility mode, practice mode, and other detailed settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for achievements, leaderboards, and cloud saving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 20XX, cities around the world were attacked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious organization \u201cFata Morgana,\u201d which possesses superweapons and controls the world's military arsenal with unknown technology, has returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The international secret rescue team \u201cProject Blue,\u201d a group of sky-riding knights, stands up against this global threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits them as they take the fight to a powerful enemy for various reasons? ......!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SONIC WINGS REUNION is a sequel to the arcade-style shooter SONIC WINGS. The previous version was sold in 1998.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 8 characters and destroy the mysterious organization \u201cFatamornagana\u201d that has progressed into the modern world. The scenario changes depending on the combination of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight initial characters, with hidden characters unlocked under certain conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight stages (including bonus stages) to fight in cities and locations in the modern world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight stages (including bonus stages) in which players fight in cities and locations in the modern world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant futuristic weapons from the original game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local cooperative play is supported. Conversation scenarios change with cooperative play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The co-op scenarios can be enjoyed in single-player mode as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three sound modes are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original sound mode is composed by Sonic Wings series sound composer Soshi Hosoi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Arrange Sound Mode, the music of previous titles is completely arranged by Japan's most renowned sound creator. The user can set the music to be played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Mao Mao mode, Mao Mao's song is played as background music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The user can select the level of difficulty, invincibility mode, practice mode, and other detailed settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for achievements, leaderboards, and cloud saving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
